{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "trading-app-collection-v2",
    "name": "TradBullKing API",
    "description": "## TradBullKing — Paper Trading API Collection\n\n### Setup\n1. Set `baseUrl` variable → `http://localhost:5000/api`\n2. Register or login → `authToken` is auto-saved\n3. For admin endpoints, use `adminToken`\n\n### Balance Logic\n| Event | Balance |\n|-------|---------|\n| Register | ₹1 Crore (trial) |\n| Pay ₹500 | ₹5 Crore (premium) |\n| Daily reset (midnight) | Reset to 5Cr (premium only) |\n| Per trade | ₹2 from feeBalance |\n\n### Socket.IO — Real-Time\nUse the **Socket.IO** folder to test real-time events.\n\n**Server:** `http://localhost:5000`\n\n**Emit events:**\n- `subscribe:stocks` → `[\"2885\", \"11536\"]`\n- `unsubscribe:stocks` → `[\"2885\"]`\n- `subscribe:all` → no data\n\n**Listen events:**\n- `price:update` → `{ token, ltp, change, changePercent, high, low, open, close, volume }`\n- `candle:update` → `{ token, time, open, high, low, close, volume }`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
