    {
      "name": "Socket.IO — Real-Time",
      "description": "## Socket.IO Real-Time Price Streaming\n\nThe backend runs a Socket.IO server at `http://localhost:5000`.\n\n### How to test in Postman\n1. Click **New** → **Socket.IO**\n2. Enter URL: `http://localhost:5000`\n3. Click **Connect**\n4. Use the **Events** tab to add listeners: `price:update`, `candle:update`\n5. Use **New Message** to emit events\n\n### Events Reference\n| Direction | Event | Payload |\n|-----------|-------|---------|\n| Emit | `subscribe:stocks` | `[\"2885\", \"11536\"]` |\n| Emit | `unsubscribe:stocks` | `[\"2885\"]` |\n| Emit | `subscribe:all` | _(no data)_ |\n| Listen | `price:update` | `{ token, ltp, change, changePercent, high, low, open, close, volume }` |\n| Listen | `candle:update` | `{ token, time, open, high, low, close, volume }` |\n| Listen | `subscribed:all` | `{ count }` |",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Connect & Subscribe to RELIANCE",
          "request": {
            "method": "SOCKETIO",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{socketUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{socketUrl}}"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "[\"{{stockToken}}\"]"
            }
          },
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {},
          "description": "**How to use in Postman:**\n1. Open a new Socket.IO request tab\n2. Enter URL: `http://localhost:5000`\n3. Click **Connect**\n4. In **Events** tab, add listener: `price:update`\n5. In **Events** tab, add listener: `candle:update`\n6. Click **New Message**, enter event: `subscribe:stocks`\n7. Enter data: `[\"2885\"]` (RELIANCE token)\n8. Click **Send**\n\n**Expected `price:update` response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"token\": \"2885\",\n  \"ltp\": 2456.75,\n  \"change\": 12.5,\n  \"changePercent\": 0.51,\n  \"high\": 2470.0,\n  \"low\": 2440.0,\n  \"open\": 2444.0,\n  \"close\": 2453.3,\n  \"volume\": 1234567\n}\n```\n\n**Expected `candle:update` response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"token\": \"2885\",\n  \"time\": 1705298100,\n  \"open\": 2450.0,\n  \"high\": 2456.75,\n  \"low\": 2448.5,\n  \"close\": 2456.75,\n  \"volume\": 5432\n}\n```"
        },
        {
          "name": "Connect & Subscribe to Multiple Stocks",
          "request": {
            "method": "SOCKETIO",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{socketUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{socketUrl}}"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "[\"2885\", \"11536\", \"1594\"]"
            }
          },
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {},
          "description": "Subscribe to multiple stocks at once.\n\n**Emit:** `subscribe:stocks`\n**Data:** `[\"2885\", \"11536\", \"1594\"]`\n\nCommon tokens:\n| Symbol | Token |\n|--------|-------|\n| RELIANCE | 2885 |\n| TCS | 11536 |\n| INFY | 1594 |\n| HDFC BANK | 1333 |\n| NIFTY 50 | 26000 |"
        },
        {
          "name": "Subscribe to All Stocks",
          "request": {
            "method": "SOCKETIO",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{socketUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{socketUrl}}"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": ""
            }
          },
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {},
          "description": "Subscribe to all active stocks in one go.\n\n**Emit:** `subscribe:all`\n**Data:** _(no data needed)_\n\n**Response event:** `subscribed:all`\n```json\n{ \"count\": 25 }\n```\nCount = number of tokens subscribed."
        },
        {
          "name": "Unsubscribe from Stock",
          "request": {
            "method": "SOCKETIO",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{socketUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{socketUrl}}"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "[\"2885\"]"
            }
          },
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {},
          "description": "Stop receiving updates for a stock.\n\n**Emit:** `unsubscribe:stocks`\n**Data:** `[\"2885\"]`\n\nNo response event — connection just stops emitting for that token."
        },
